{"atom_id":"atom-0049","atom_type":"requirement","canonical_summary":"Goal evidence must distinguish source evidence, canonical/live target evidence, process evidence, and governance evidence so source ledgers or pipeline/process artifacts are not mistaken for completed canonical product/spec content.","compile_disposition":"create_new_planunit","compile_notes":"Compiled to live canonical Plans PlanUnits; governance seal completed.","compiled_at_utc":"2026-06-16T05:06:00Z","compiled_output_plan_unit_ids":["GRS-012","CV-286","SP-214"],"created_at_utc":"2026-06-16T04:00:00Z","exact_tokens":["source evidence","canonical evidence","process evidence","governance evidence"],"gui_classification_reason":"Backend/orchestration or product architecture; not GUI/UI or visual implementation work.","gui_related":false,"lane":"completion","ledger_id":"pldg-20260616-001-goal-runtime-system","negative_constraints":["Do not mix source evidence into canonical evidence fields."],"owner_hints":["Plans/Goal_Runtime_System.md"],"plan_compile_targets":[],"schema_id":"pm.bootstrap_design_atom.v1","source_refs":["chat:goal-mode-design-thread","repo:Plans/ledgers/v2/README.md","repo:Concepts/PMConcept.html"],"status":"compiled_to_plan","superseded_by":[],"supersedes":[],"title":"Source/canonical/process evidence separation","updated_at_utc":"2026-06-16T20:30:00Z"}
{"atom_id":"atom-0107","atom_type":"requirement","canonical_summary":"Verifier/adjudicator unavailable behavior is tiered. Low-risk goals may finish with a degraded receipt. Standard goals may degrade only when no mutation or required check is affected. Strong-certification goals become blocked, not complete, when the verifier/adjudicator requirement cannot be met.","compile_disposition":"create_new_planunit","compile_notes":"Compiled to live canonical Plans PlanUnits; governance seal completed.","compiled_at_utc":"2026-06-16T05:06:00Z","compiled_output_plan_unit_ids":["GRS-014","SP-214"],"created_at_utc":"2026-06-16T04:34:00Z","exact_tokens":["Verifier unavailable behavior should be tiered","low-risk goals may finish with a degraded receipt","standard goals may degrade only when no mutation or required check is affected","strong-certification goals become blocked, not complete"],"gui_classification_reason":"Runtime completion and degraded-mode policy; not GUI/UI or visual implementation work.","gui_related":false,"lane":"completion","ledger_id":"pldg-20260616-001-goal-runtime-system","negative_constraints":["Do not complete strong-certification goals in degraded verifier mode.","Do not degrade standard goals when mutation or required checks are affected."],"owner_hints":["Plans/Goal_Runtime_System.md"],"plan_compile_targets":[],"schema_id":"pm.bootstrap_design_atom.v1","source_refs":["chat:lock-final-policy-defaults"],"status":"compiled_to_plan","superseded_by":[],"supersedes":[],"title":"Tiered verifier unavailable behavior","updated_at_utc":"2026-06-16T20:30:00Z"}
